  "description": "Beautiful 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom semi detached house available to rent in Portlaoise.\n\nWhen enquiring, please include:\n- The number of people who would live in the property.\n- Your preferred move-in date.\n- How long you hope to rent for.\n- Your availability for a viewing.\nRent is €2,500 per month, excluding bills. Please do not attach personal or financial documents to your initial enquiry..\n\nThe property is in excellent condition throughout and has an A2 BER rating, making it very energy efficient and comfortable to heat.\n\nAccommodation\n\nThe ground floor has a bright open plan kitchen and dining area with a large island, modern fitted kitchen and plenty of storage.\n\nThere is also a separate living room, downstairs bathroom and utility area with washing machine and dryer.\n\nUpstairs there are three good sized bedrooms and two further bathrooms.\n\nThe house is fully furnished and very well presented throughout.\n\nOutside\n\nThere is a private enclosed rear garden with a patio area.\n\nLocation\n\nThe property is in a very convenient part of Portlaoise, within walking distance of Portlaoise Hospital, local shops and other amenities. Portlaoise town centre is also close by. Household bin collection is included in the monthly rent.\n\nMain Features\n\n• 3 bedrooms\n• 3 bathrooms\n• A2 BER rating\n• Modern kitchen with large island\n• Separate living room\n• Utility area\n• Washing machine and dryer\n• Fully furnished\n• Private rear garden\n• Patio area\n• Walking distance to Portlaoise Hospital\n• Close to shops and town centre",
